  "name": "Auto Ranging ",
  "slug": "auto-ranging",
  "teaser": "Automatically adjusts your scope zeroing to match the distance of whatever you're aiming at. Supports both continuous auto-ranging and on-demand manual ranging via key bind.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/lWNBEuze9MZIa9a5IZ6VEEV7WQwajEUaxBzqqODp.jpg",
  "downloads": 3360,
  "favourites_count": 27,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Automatically adjusts your scope’s zeroing/BDC calibration to match the actual distance to whatever you’re aiming at while ADS — no more manually scrolling through zero distances mid-fight.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto-detects distance via raycast while aiming down sights, updates your scope’s calibrated distance in real time</li>\n<li>Manual mode available — disable auto-ranging and use a keybind instead (default <strong>Alt+R</strong>)</li>\n<li>Master on/off toggle</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Extract the archive</li>\n<li>Drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your SPT root directory</li>\n<li>Press <strong>F12</strong> to toggle Auto Range on/off, or switch to manual keybind mode</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Limitations / Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>None currently known. If you find one, please report it (see Support tab).</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have a question? Leave a comment on this mod’s page, or reach out in my thread on the SPT Discord: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
